per year in subscriptions. Syenxa Tech standard business websites start at $200 with delivery in 5 to 7 working days."},{"question":"What are the ongoing costs of a website?","answer":"Expect $1,000 to $6,000 per year for hosting, domain, maintenance and support on a typical small business site. Modern Next.js sites hosted on an edge network usually sit at the low end because there are no plugins to update and hosting is often free or a few dollars a month at small-business traffic levels."},{"question":"Is a cheap website worth it?","answer":"Only if it is fast, mobile-friendly, indexable and built to convert. A low price is fine when it comes from an efficient process rather than cut corners. Check load speed, look for structured data and proper metadata, and make sure you own the code and domain."}],"keyTakeaways":["A professional small business website in the US costs $2,000 to $8,000 in 2026 from a freelancer and $8,000 to $15,000+ from a boutique agency.","61% of small business buyers spent under $10,000 on their last website, according to the Clutch 2026 survey.","Ongoing hosting, maintenance and support add $1,000 to $6,000 per year; a modern Next.js build keeps that near the bottom of the range."],"content":["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-8","children":[["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"short-answer","children":"The short answer"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["A small business website in the USA costs between $2,000 and $8,000 in 2026 for a professional, custom-designed site from a freelancer, and $8,000 to $15,000 or more from a boutique agency, with advanced builds reaching $35,000 (",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://elementor.com/blog/how-much-does-a-small-business-website-cost/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","children":"Elementor"}],"). The Clutch 2026 survey found 61% of small business buyers spent under $10,000 on their most recent site (",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/website-development-cost-2026-complete-pricing-data","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","children":"Digital Applied"}],"). DIY builders cost a few hundred dollars a year but leave the work, and the results, to you."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"by-build-type","children":"Cost by build type"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"not-prose my-8 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-zinc-900/10","children":[["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"mb-4 font-display font-bold text-zinc-900","children":"Small business website cost by build type (US, 2026)"}],["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 640 244","role":"img","aria-labelledby":"small-business-website-cost-by-build-type-usa-2026-title small-business-website-cost-by-build-type-usa-2026-desc","className":"w-full h-auto ","children":[["$","title",null,{"id":"small-business-website-cost-by-build-type-usa-2026-title","children":"Small business website cost by build type, USA 2026"}],["$","desc",null,{"id":"small-business-website-cost-by-build-type-usa-2026-desc","children":"Range bars comparing 2026 US website costs: DIY builders 200 to 600 dollars a year, freelancers 2,000 to 8,000 dollars, boutique agencies 8,000 to 15,000 dollars or more, and Syenxa Tech from 200 dollars."}],[["$","g","DIY builder",{"children":[["$","text",null,{"x":"0","y":34,"fontSize":"15","fontWeight":"600","fill":"#18181b","children":"DIY builder"}],["$","rect",null,{"x":150,"y":18,"width":320,"height":26,"rx":"13","fill":"rgba(24,24,27,0.08)"}],["$","rect",null,{"x":154,"y":18,"width":18,"height":26,"rx":"13","fill":"#a1a1aa"}],["$","text",null,{"x":482,"y":36,"fontSize":"14","fontWeight":"700","fill":"#18181b","children":"$$200 to $600 / yr"}]]}],["$","g","Freelancer",{"children":[["$","text",null,{"x":"0","y":90,"fontSize":"15","fontWeight":"600","fill":"#18181b","children":"Freelancer"}],["$","rect",null,{"x":150,"y":74,"width":320,"height":26,"rx":"13","fill":"rgba(24,24,27,0.08)"}],["$","rect",nul