the price"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Number of pages and templates."}]," A 6-page brochure site and a 40-page site with service and location pages are very different jobs."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Custom design vs template."}]," Original layouts, illustration and photography add design hours."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Functionality."}]," Booking, e-commerce, customer portals, calculators and multi-language support each add scope."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Content."}]," Writing and structuring copy around the keywords your customers search takes time, and it is where most cheap sites fall down."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Technical SEO."}]," Metadata, schema, sitemaps, image optimization and Core Web Vitals work are either included or sold as an add-on. Ask."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Integrations."}]," CRM, email marketing, chat widgets and AI agents connected at build time save money later."]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"ongoing-costs","children":"Ongoing costs to budget for"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"not-prose overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-zinc-900/10 bg-white my-6","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[560px] text-left text-sm","children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"className":"border-b border-zinc-900/10 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500","children":[["$","th","Item",{"scope":"col","className":"p-4","children":"Item"}],["$","th","Typical annual cost (US)",{"scope":"col","className":"p-4","children":"Typical annual cost (US)"}],["$","th","Notes",{"scope":"col","className":"p-4","children":"Notes"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","Domain",{"className":"border-b border-zinc-900/5 last:border-0","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"p-4 font-medium text-zinc-800","children":"Domain"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"p-4 text-zinc-600","children":"$$10 to $20"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"p-4 text-zinc-600","children":"Paid to the registrar"}]]}],["$","tr","Hosting",{"className":"border-b border-zinc-900/5 last:border-0","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"p-4 font-medium text-zinc-800","children":"Hosting"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"p-4 text-zinc-600","children":"$$0 to $600"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"p-4 text-zinc-600","children":"Edge hosting for Next.js is often free at small-business traffic; managed WordPress costs more"}]]}],["$","tr","Maintenance and updates",{"className":"border-b border-zinc-900/5 last:border-0","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"p-4 font-medium text-zinc-800","children":"Maintenance and updates"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"p-4 text-zinc-600","children":"$$600 to $1,800"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"p-4 text-zinc-600","children":"Plugin-based CMSs need regular patching; modern stacks need far less"}]]}],["$","tr","Content and SEO",{"className":"border-b border-zinc-900/5 last:border-0","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"p-4 font-medium text-zinc-800","children":"Content and SEO"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"p-4 text-zinc-600","children":"$$0 to $3,000+"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"p-4 text-zinc-600","children":"Optional, but the main lever for growth after launch"}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Industry guides put total ongoing costs at $1,000 to $6,000 per year for a typical small business site (",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://elementor.com/blog/how-much-does-a-small-business-website-cost/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","children":"Elementor"}],"). Sites without a plugin ecosystem sit at the low end."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"cheap-vs-expensive","children":"Why quotes vary so much"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Two vendors can quote $500 and $12,000 for what sounds like the same website. The difference is usually process and reuse. An agency starting from a blank page bills for discovery workshops, wireframes, revisions and project management. A team working from a proven, fast foundation with a fixed five-step process spends its time on your content, design and conversions rather than on rebuilding the basics. Low price is a warning sign only when it comes with slow pages, templates you do not own, or no SEO fundamentals."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"how-to-budget","children":"How to budget without overpaying"}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"List the pages and features you need for the next 12 months, not the next 5 years."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Ask every vendor whether technical SEO, mobile optimization and analytics are included."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Request two live reference sites and test their speed on your phone."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Confirm you will own the domain, code and design files."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Budget separately for content and SEO after launch; that is where traffic comes from."}],["$","li",null,{"children":["Decide whether lead follow-up should be automated. A website connected to an"," ",["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/ai-chatbots","children":"AI chatbot"}]," or"," ",["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/ai-calling-agents","children":"AI calling agent"}]," ","converts more of the traffic you pay for."]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"syenxa-pricing","children":"How Syenxa Tech prices websites"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Standard business websites start at $200 USD and go live in 5 to 7 working days, with custom design, mobile-first Next.js code, technical SEO and analytics included. E-commerce stores, web applications and multi-language sites are quoted after a free discovery call. Hosting and domain fees are paid to the provider, and we set them up at no charge. See our"," ",["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/website-development","children":"website development services"}]," ","and portfolio, or"," ",["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/contact","children":"request a fixed quote"}],"."]}]]}]]}]}]],null,["$","$Le",null,{"children":"$Lf"}]]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],["$","$1","h",{"children":[null,["$","$1","3p21RAgcoeulmWt0XqXbT",{"children":[["$","$L10",null,{"children":"$L11"}],["$","$L12",null,{"children":"$L13"}],null]}]]}],false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$14","$undefined"],"s":false,"S":true}
